				1
			],
			"Message": "docs(Common): Add landscape emoji to ecosystem section header\n\nAppend the 🏞️ (national park) emoji to the section header in README.md, joining the existing worker (👨🏻‍🏭) emoji to visually represent the Land ecosystem components in the Common documentation.\n\nThis enhances the README's visual appeal while maintaining consistency with the emoji-based component representation used elsewhere in the project documentation.",
